* precharge_models.lib -- models for precharge_Rsweep.asc

* D1/D2 input TVS, SMCJ58A: Vbr 64.4-71.2 V @ 1 mA, Vc 93.6 V @ 16 A
.model DSMCJ58A D(Is=1p N=1 Rs=1.7 BV=66 Ibv=1m Cjo=1.5n)

* Constant-power load (aux converters) that only turns on above Von.
* Pload and Von are set on the schematic. Pload=0 disables it.
* Follows the bus through a ~10 kHz filter (converter loop bandwidth).
.subckt CPL_EN_BEH P N
RF   P  VF 100k
CF   VF N  160p
BCPL P  N  I={Pload}/max(V(VF,N),10)*(0.5+0.5*tanh((V(VF,N)-{Von})/0.5))
.ends CPL_EN_BEH
